with open('WORKLOG.md', 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:
    f.write('\n---\n\n## 2026-09-30\n\n### 🐛 Fix: Total Km lookup failure caused by invisible zero-width spaces\n**Files:** `frontend/src/jsx/components/CommonMaster/SalesmanVisitings.jsx`\n\n- Fixed an issue where the `Total Km` field remained blank even when valid Delivery Locations were selected.\n- Identified that `DeliveryLocation.location_name` contains a hidden zero-width space (`\\u200B`) appended by the backend to identify auto-generated polygon points.\n- Since the `AreaGeofenceHistory` stores location names without this character, strict string matching (`===`) in React was failing.\n- Added `.replace(/[\\u200B]/g, "").trim()` during segment lookup in the frontend to securely match locations and correctly display the total distance.\n\n*Last updated: 2026-09-30 15:50 IST*\n')
